  "extra_findings": [
    "Fixed shared export path EXPORT_DIR/chamados.csv under /var/www — concurrent requests can read each other's CSV and the file may be web-reachable (lib.php:125-150; part of F4, mapped to BUG-004)",
    "CSV header is emitted by fputcsv as ID,Titulo,Status,Tecnico,\"Aberto em\" and fputcsv without explicit $escape is deprecated in PHP 8.4 (lib.php:130; F8)",
    "connect_errno check unreachable on PHP 8.1+ because new mysqli throws mysqli_sql_exception, possibly leaking DB user/host (index.php:9-12; F10)",
    "TypeError / HTTP 500 when ver, busca or login are sent as arrays (index.php:22,52,72; F12)",
    "Session cookie without HttpOnly/SameSite and use_strict_mode off (index.php:15; bundled in F7)",
    "SEC-005 — no CSRF token on the login POST (named in the non-changes list)"
  ],
